Repository context: {{repo_full}} at {{commit_sha}}; scope {{repo_scope}}; dependencies {{dependencies}}; configuration {{configuration}}; workspace root {{workspace_root}}.

Treat https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-7540 as authoritative.

Check every applicable normative requirement in this domain, including MUST, MUST NOT, relevant SHOULD, and clearly normative behavioral statements.

Verify:

* whether asynchronous deposits, asynchronous redemptions, or both are actually implemented;
* whether any non-asynchronous flow retains normal synchronous ERC-4626 behavior;
* whether ERC-4626 remains implemented with the overrides required by ERC-7540;
* required ERC-165 interface support and accurate capability detection;
* ERC-7575 requirements explicitly imposed by ERC-7540;
* required ERC-7540 signatures and overloads;
* consistency between declared interface support and reachable implementation behavior.

Resolve inheritance, libraries, proxies, factories, configuration gates, and active implementations before concluding that required behavior is absent.

Do not perform a general ERC-4626, ERC-7575, economic, or protocol audit. Do not convert MAY behavior or permitted implementation choices into requirements.

Emit one candidate record per materially distinct concrete deviation.

For each candidate include:

* stable candidate key;
* domain;
* mapped target and active configuration;
* exact ERC-7540 requirement and classification;
* specification section;
* precise source locations;
* expected behavior;
* actual reachable behavior;
* realistic ordered trigger;
* impact;
* relevant actor or neutral integrator;
* production path;
* inheritance/configuration checked;
* counterchecks performed;
* unresolved assumptions.

Evidence must establish reachable production behavior, not merely names, comments, interface declarations, or an apparent omission in one child contract.

Do not adjudicate severity or force a final finding at this stage. If all requirements in this domain are compliant, not applicable, or not proven violated, emit zero records.

